{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39969","headline":"辇下赠屯田何员外 · 徐夤","name":"辇下赠屯田何员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"封章频得帝咨嗟，报国唯将直破邪。\n身到西山书几达，官登南省鬓初华。\n厨非寒食还无火，菊待重阳拟泛茶。\n内翰好才兼好古，秋来应数到君家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}